<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine c. bank sells dollars at 29 pesos.</title>
<headline>Philippine c. bank sells dollars at 29 pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine central bank sold dollars early on Wednesday at 29 pesos, traders said.</p>
<p>It was the only seller in the market. Volume was $24 million after 50 minutes of trading, they said.  </p>
<p>&quot;It (central bank) has to sell or the rate will fly away,&quot; a trader said.</p>
<p>Bankers said there was a pent-up demand for dollars from commercial clients.</p>
<p>-- Lilian Karunungan (63 2) 841-8937</p>
</text>
